        "text": {
          "text": "員工非常友善熱情，總是帶著微笑歡迎每一位顧客。\n\n隨時提供協助。\n\n適合學習或與朋友聊天。\n\n聚會的好去處😃😊",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Very nice & friendly staff, with smiling and warm welcome to all customers.\n\nAlways provide assistance whenever you need.\n\nGood for studying or chatting with friends.\n\nGood place for gathering 😃😊",
